{"title":"Moonhart","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 45 Moonbeast that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 4 times (2.1% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/moonhart-antler\">Moonhart Antler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonhart\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonhart?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>35</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonhart?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>70</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonhart?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>50</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/moonhart?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/moonhart?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/moonhart?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>35</td><td>in the wilds around 1501, 1473</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/moonhart?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>70</td><td>in the wilds around 1504, 1393</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/moonhart?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>50</td><td>in the wilds around 1491, 1387</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/moonhart\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>8</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/moonhart?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>6</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Sunken%20Avenue\">Sunken Avenue</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"moonhart\" data-map-level=\"47\">Show level 47 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 102 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-hide\" title=\"Silver Hide - in 90% of 102 looted corpses, 90 recorded drops, 272 total, 1–5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">90% · 92/102</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dro